sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor P as Pessoa
  participant App as App.tsx
  participant H as useWeather
  participant S as weatherService
  participant G as Open-Meteo Geocoding
  participant F as Open-Meteo Forecast

  P->>App: digita cidade e envia
  App->>H: search(nome)
  Note over H: cancela requisição anterior (AbortController)
  H->>S: searchCities(nome, signal)
  S->>G: GET /v1/search?name=...&count=5&language=pt
  G-->>S: JSON com results
  S-->>H: City[] validadas
  H-->>App: status results (ou empty)
  P->>App: escolhe uma cidade
  App->>H: selectCity(city)
  H->>S: getWeather(city, signal)
  S->>F: GET /v1/forecast?latitude&longitude&current&daily
  F-->>S: JSON current + daily
  S-->>H: WeatherData validado
  H-->>App: status success + data
  Note over App: troca de unidade converte em memória, sem nova requisição
